## Case: legacy-16-option-result-020-result-propagate
id: "legacy.16_option_result.020_result_propagate"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "result_propagate.at"
```auto
fn try_parse(s str) !int {
    if s == "" {
        return Err("empty string")
    }
    Ok(42)
}

fn chain() !int {
    let a = try_parse("hello").?
    let b = try_parse("").?
    Ok(a + b)
}

let result = chain()
is result {
    Ok(n) -> print(n)
    Err(e) -> print("propagated error")
}
```

### VM result
#ignore
check-id: "vm-stdout"

```text
propagated error
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/language-source-run-v1"
entry: "d_main"
caps: ["ac.source.language.av/v1", "console.stdout", "console.stderr"]
channel: "unit"

#### stdout

```text
